ory":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Lake County record runs 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids August to September came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those 75 years. In 2025 the middle had January to February at 37% of normal and April to May at 59%. So far in 2026, June to July on the middle came in at 151% of normal. Grid 25370 had its driest year in 1963 at 62%.</p>"}
